# Environment
.env

# Raw CMS downloads: re-fetchable with `make data`, ~24 MB, no need to track.
data/raw/

# Build by-product: the un-quantised vectors (151 MB). They exist only so the
# evaluation can measure what int8 costs; the shipped index is the int8 one.
data/index/dense_float32.npy

# The parsed corpus (data/processed) and the int8 + BM25 indexes (data/index)
# ARE committed on purpose: it makes `git clone && make serve` work without a
# 26-minute embedding run, and it makes the deployed container reproducible.

